    <briefdescription>
<para>Autonomous OMA LwM2M Client Supervisor Task &amp; Engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements an event-driven cooperative client task for OMA LwM2M v1.1/v1.2:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Autonomous Server Registration, 80% Lifetime Renewal, and Deregistration.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Transport management over UDP or DTLS 1.3 (via <ref refid="syn__coap_8h_1aa59424cac0a096b6d994e2c1ee3b2d29" kindref="member">SYN_CoapsClient</ref>).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Downlink CoAP Request Dispatch (Read, Write, Execute, Discover).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>RFC 7641 Observe &amp; Notify scheduler matching periodic pmax &amp; value triggers.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Standard Device Object (Obj 3) reboot/reset and Firmware Update (Obj 5) dispatch. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
